From b1560c138fe25a1f5008c439b5fe8465225c1ba9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bb-machine <ubuntu@bb-machine>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:15:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(admission): retain native decisions and original
 delivery

Evaluate native messages before acceptance and persist exact operations, publications, originals, immutable acknowledgements and correlated advice. Preserve accepted input through queue claims, retries and historical replacements; reconcile uncertain effects without blind replay. Expose stable submission identities and explicit separately evaluated corrections through SDK, CLI and current preparation UI.
